    "verdict_remediated": "GR29_REMEDIATION_REQUIRED",
    "GR29-R01": {
      "finding": "take_snapshot publishes the new observation and only then derives staleness over every decision; a malformed HumanDecision refused at _decision_from_row aborted that derivation after publication, leaving snapshot_current on the new reality, prior approvals VALID against the reality they superseded, suspension NONE and the REALITY_DRIFT escalation unreached.",
      "correction": "controller.py _suspend_uninterpreted_snapshot (guard:snapshot_interpretation_suspends) raises an INTEGRITY_VIOLATION escalation applying SUSPENDED_BY_INTEGRITY (transition-matrix §4 row 4-7) and re-raises. The refusal, the read guard and the no-repair rule are unchanged; no malformed row is skipped, coerced or migrated.",
      "why_this_suspension": "SUSPENSION_GATE gives SUSPENDED_BY_INTEGRITY and SUSPENDED_BY_DRIFT the same row (no new invocations, validations or commits; ABANDONED the only lifecycle target), so the project is barred exactly as the drift suspension this path could not reach would have barred it, by the route verify_commit and the commit receipt already take for an integrity violation.",
      "nesting": "Written through _raise_escalation, so where take_snapshot is nested in a caller's transaction (_settle_commit_receipt) the suspension rolls back with the publication it answers for.",
      "regression": "tests/test_gr29_decision_principal_key.py::test_a_failed_staleness_derivation_suspends_the_project reproduces the reviewer's sequence and asserts the durable state twice, the second time through a store and controller opened after the first closed. test_a_readable_project_is_not_suspended_by_the_new_gate holds the healthy path to REALITY_DRIFT/SUSPENDED_BY_DRIFT.",
      "red_evidence": "Before the correction the regression failed at 'assert <SuspensionState.NONE: \\'NONE\\'> is <SuspensionState.SUSPENDED_BY_INTEGRITY: \\'SUSPENDED_BY_INTEGRITY\\'>'; an exploratory run of the same sequence showed propose_commit succeeding against the superseded reality. .evidence/gr29-r01/red.log (gitignored).",
      "not_done": "No storage migration, no repair or backfill of malformed rows, no scan for them, and no change to how an integrity suspension is cleared (§4 row 4-20 remains a human's act)."
    },
    "GR29-R02": "The hollowing explanation said the recording boundary refuses three of the five actors that test parametrizes. It refuses five of five: two actor-kind refusals, two authentication refusals and one principal-key refusal. Corrected in hollowed_and_repaired[0].cause and in the docstring of tests/test_gr23_creation_path.py::test_creation_requires_an_authenticated_human_approval. No mutation count was changed by this correction."
  }
